	</tr><tr>
		<td class="grid_col2" align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									Drinal Open Raids - 
									3/9/2005 6:50:05 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Welcome to Drinal's new Open Raiding organization!&nbsp; We'll begin leading raids on Friday, March 18th and continue them regularly on Fridays (and probably other nights once&nbsp;the leaders talk it out)&nbsp;at 7:30PM CST (8:30 EST, 5:30PST).&nbsp; Our purpose is to offer a group where anyone can come to enjoy raiding and&nbsp;work through raid progression.&nbsp; OR will be starting out with planar raids, and we'll see where we can go from there.&nbsp; Our only restriction on participation is that you must be able to enter the zone we're raiding.<br /><br />I know loot is high on everyone's mind, so here's the rundown on how it will be distributed.&nbsp; We'll be using a DKP system to encourage regular participation.&nbsp; Anyone&nbsp;able to use an item and above the recommended level will be allowed to go in on a drop.&nbsp; You can begin earning DKP after your first three raids with us (this means we'll be /randoming drops for the first four raids we run).<br /><br />Last but not least, we're always looking for people to help with leading and/or organizing raids.&nbsp; If you're interested in helping out in any way, please let me know.&nbsp; You don't have to have experience, everyone learns sometime.&nbsp; So if you think you'd enjoy helping out, speak up.<br /><br />-Jetta Starr<br />Gnome Bedazzler
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr>
